  startButton: {fileID: 1030982997}
  confirmButton: {fileID: 1505601555}
  helpButton: {fileID: 2063568092}
  infoPanel: {fileID: 2059983173}
  infoCloseButton: {fileID: 1597270428}
  infoBody: {fileID: 1969143083}
  infoText: '<b>How it works</b>


    1.  Put on the band and turn on your phone''s
    hotspot.

    2.  Point the phone at a table and move it slowly. When a grid
    appears, tap it to place the disk.

    3.  Rest your forearm on the table, palm
    down and relaxed, then tap <b>Set zero</b>.

    4.  Tap <b>Start</b>. Twist
    your wrist to turn the <color=#E5484D>red notch</color> onto the <color=#30A46C>green
    needle</color>, then tap <b>Confirm</b>.


    Each round has several targets.
    Be quick, but be accurate.'
